

This tarball contains two files.  The distribution files are in
the file named ncsu-FreePDK3D45-1.1.tar.gz. 

You can check the integrity of this file using the detached
signature file ncsu-FreePDK3D45-1.1.tar.gz.sig using this command:

gpg --verify ncsu-FreePDK3D45-1.1.tar.gz.sig

For complete information on verification see this page:

http://www.eda.ncsu.edu/wiki/NCSU_EDA_Wiki:Kit_verification
